[{"type":"message","user":"U0177HB2VA8","text":"確かに。\n追記しておきます","ts":"1633093134.371400","attachments":[{"color":"D0D0D0","fallback":"[October 1st, 2021 9:18 PM] shougo.matsu: READMEにかいておくべきかもしれない","author_id":"U7JL1UKKL","author_name":"Shougo","author_subname":"Shougo","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U7JL1UKKL","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7f5a1bfaf8b64cbcdfaf82a7de92506b.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-48.png","text":"READMEにかいておくべきかもしれない","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-lsp","ts":1633090692.371000,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CQ57P4XU4/p1633090692371000"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"ded01ce0-880a-4d7d-80f0-0f7134f6e22c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"READMEにかいておくべきかもしれない","ts":"1633090692.371000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BTayP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8EE051E7-60C6-48D5-A6C2-F352788F5F51","type":"message","user":"U0177HB2VA8","text":"皆さんに色々見てもらいながらも、なんとか真因にはたどり着けました。ありがとうございました。\n結果的には仕様通りの挙動だったので、ddc-vim-lsp 使っている方がいましたら、isVolatileをv:true で設定すると体験良くなりそうです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/shun/ddc-vim-lsp/issues/8#issuecomment-931473891|https://github.com/shun/ddc-vim-lsp/issues/8#issuecomment-931473891\u003e","ts":"1633089743.369800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/shun/ddc-vim-lsp/issues/8#issuecomment-931473891|Comment on #8 user_data is not completed\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/shun/ddc-vim-lsp/issues/8#issuecomment-931473891|Comment on #8 user_data is not completed\u003e","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/Bakudankun|@Bakudankun\u003e  \nThanks for your investigation.\n\nI also reached the root cause which is exactly same as your report in parallel.\n\nMaybe, this sequence is correct;\n\n1. detect input text\n2. ddc-vim-lsp send the request to vim-lsp.\n3. vim-lsp send the response to ddc-vim-lsp.\n4. ddc-vim-lsp calls ddc#refresh_candidates.\n5. ddc calles gatherCandidates.\n6. After this, ddc call CompleteDone.\n7. Then, vim-lsp clear managed_user_data_map.\n\nMy opinion is below.  \nWhen input \"p\" with below case, ddc should call gaterCandidates.\n\n```\n    fmt.p|.    # | \u0026lt;- caret\n```\n\nHowever, ddc doesn't call gatherCandidates because of below conditions.\n\n```\n[denops] prevInput: [^Ifmt.]\n[denops] result.prevInput: [^Ifmt.]\n[denops] completeStr:  [p]\n[denops] result.completeStr: []\n\n```\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim/blob/0f3eb8a82ddbe7bd3cc0b43adbb6de7fb659fb64/denops/ddc/ddc.ts#L352|https://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim/blob/0f3eb8a82ddbe7bd3cc0b43adbb6de7fb659fb64/denops/ddc/ddc.ts#L352\u003e\n\n```\n      if (\n        !result ||\n        prevInput != result.prevInput ||\n        !completeStr.startsWith(result.completeStr) ||\n        context.lineNr != result.lineNr ||\n        context.event == \"Manual\" ||\n        context.event == \"AutoRefresh\" ||\n        context.event == \"ManualRefresh\" ||\n        o.isVolatile\n      ) {\n        // Not matched.\n        const scs = await callSourceGatherCandidates(\n```\n\nI think this bug is not for this plugin.  \nBut I don't know this is for ddc.vim.\n\nSo, it is better to ask \u003chttps://github.com/Shougo|@Shougo\u003e.","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/shun/ddc-vim-lsp|shun/ddc-vim-lsp\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1633018956}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":7,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U06ECBRTJ","UAZ33BKV2","U01G63H9VN3","U01BY3SDBRS","U011FTGJ3SN","U8R597E9H"]},{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL","U011FTGJ3SN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Msxr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e72742e-0bfc-445a-987e-8f4